e just shorter we love that Sookie  me included a purple clamshell necklace  as a nod to Ariel stop the cherry on top  of this piece is cute girly flounder  we've never seen such perfect lashes on  a fish every Disney Prince should get an  animal sidekick Ariel is just as  beautiful and otherworldly imagined as a  man this Disney Prince is short to win  over anyone princesses or princes we  hope you loved seeing these Disney  treasures reimagined we'll see you next  time  [Music]

